{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06099","headline":"哭褚司马 · 王维","name":"哭褚司马","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"妄识皆心累，浮生定死媒。\n谁言老龙吉，未免伯牛灾。\n故有求仙药，仍余遯俗杯。\n山川秋树苦，窗户夜泉哀。\n尚忆青骡去，宁知白马来。\n汉臣修史记，莫蔽褚生才。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06099.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06099","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}